<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ten stocks fell and nine were flat in 14.7-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,603.6 points, 0.5 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 1.1 percent in a 13.7-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
